# ============================================================
# OSCam DVBAPI - POLAND / AIO PANEL
# Universal Polish satellite priority profile
# Updated: 2026-09-10
#
# Goal:
# - prioritise CAIDs used by Polish satellite platforms
# - keep foreign platforms and other satellites available
# - no global ignore rules
# - no CAID mapping or delays affecting other packages
# ============================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# CANAL+ Polska / Hot Bird 13E
# Main/current systems first; legacy/fallback systems later.
# ------------------------------------------------------------
P: 1884:000000
P: 1813:000068
P: 0B01:000000
P: 0100:000068

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Polsat Box / Hot Bird 13E
# 1861/1803 are placed first as the most useful generic
# priorities; remaining broadcast CAIDs stay as fallbacks.
# ------------------------------------------------------------
P: 1861:000000
P: 1803:000000
P: 186C:000000
P: 1870:000000
P: 06ED:000000

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Orange Polska SAT / Hot Bird 13E
# Provider-specific rule avoids prioritising unrelated Viaccess
# packages using CAID 0500 on other satellites/providers.
# ------------------------------------------------------------
P: 0500:032A00

# ============================================================
# IMPORTANT
# There are intentionally NO I: rules and NO "I: 0" rule.
# CAIDs/providers not listed above remain available to OSCam.
# This allows foreign platforms and services from other
# satellites to use their normal CAIDs/readers.
# ============================================================
